<title>JAPAN: JR West hits record high on buying before year-end.</title>
<headline>JR West hits record high on buying before year-end.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Japan Railway Co shares rose to a record high on Tuesday morning, lifted by investors hurrying to buy the shares ahead of the fiscal year-end, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0147 GMT, the shares were 4,000 yen higher at 405,000, or 2,000 yen above the share's previous record high.</p>
